    "text": "I got beans, greens, potatoes, tomatoes, lamb, fries, y'all, y'all, beans, greens, potatoes, tomatoes, chicken, turkeys, wrap, you made it!"
  },
  {
    "start": 10.68,
    "end": 11.68,
    "text": "Hurts has time."
  },
  {
    "start": 12.1,
    "end": 13.841,
    "text": "Now locates Barkley out of the backfield."
  },
  {
    "start": 13.901,
    "end": 17.202,
    "text": "Barkley slips two tackles and picks up the first down."
  },
  {
    "start": 17.482,
    "end": 18.922,
    "text": "Tripping up in the air to the 30."
  },
  {
    "start": 19.942,
    "end": 22.723,
    "text": "The amount of moves right here makes the first guy miss."
  },
  {
    "start": 22.963,
    "end": 25.264,
    "text": "The spin move at the last second."
  },
  {
    "start": 25.764,
    "end": 28.045,
    "text": "What is that?"
  },
  {
    "start": 28.385,
    "end": 31.405,
    "text": "Bro, he turned around."
  },
  {
    "start": 31.465,
    "end": 32.286,
    "text": "Jumped over him."
  },
  {
    "start": 33.826,
    "end": 36.987,
    "text": "With six different receivers, and this time he lost one inch."
  },
  {
    "start": 38.368,
    "end": 40.229,
    "text": "Picked off at the goal line."
  },
  {
    "start": 40.549,
    "end": 41.73,
    "text": "That's Buda Baker."
  },
  {
    "start": 42.09,
    "end": 43.55,
    "text": "Buda Baker out in front."
  },
  {
    "start": 43.57,
    "end": 45.051,
    "text": "Can Metcalf track him down?"
  },
  {
    "start": 45.251,
    "end": 46.392,
    "text": "Can he chase him down?"
  },
  {
    "start": 47.252,
    "end": 49.373,
    "text": "And he does to save a touchdown."
  },
  {
    "start": 49.393,
    "end": 52.755,
    "text": "And Metcalf just refused to let it go."
  },
  {
    "start": 53.495,
    "end": 56.577,
    "text": "It was unbelievable how much ground he made up."
  },
  {
    "start": 56.617,
    "end": 62.719,
    "text": "That had to be 10 yards on a very fast Buda Baker, and he just tracked him down."
  },
  {
    "start": 64.94,
    "end": 65.701,
    "text": "Four-man rush."
  },
  {
    "start": 67.39,
    "end": 69.211,
    "text": "Rogers to the end zone."
  },
  {
    "start": 69.691,
    "end": 73.513,
    "text": "And Wilson hitting one-handed and stay inbounds."
  },
  {
    "start": 74.414,
    "end": 77.856,
    "text": "The left shin hit the ground inbounds before the knee went out of bounds."
  },
  {
    "start": 77.876,
    "end": 81.918,
    "text": "It is a touchdown."
  },
  {
    "start": 82.998,
    "end": 85.159,
    "text": "Every yard, I mean, they're having to earn every bit of it."
  },
  {
    "start": 86.2,
    "end": 89.762,
    "text": "Walker out of the backfield, flag down on the far side of the field."
  },
  {
    "start": 90.482,
    "end": 91.863,
    "text": "They're letting this play go."
  },
  {
    "start": 92.003,
    "end": 93.804,
    "text": "For now, Walker's got a first down."
  },
  {
    "start": 95.396,
    "end": 101.555,
    "text": "He was brought down, but evidently wasn't down by contact, but a flag is down on the far side of the field."
  },
  {
    "start": 103.481,
    "end": 104.983,
    "text": "And Manning's going to heed."
  },
  {
    "start": 105.523,
    "end": 107.585,
    "text": "One is... Oh, there's a flag."
  },
  {
    "start": 107.965,
    "end": 109.466,
    "text": "Beckham's one-handed catch."
  },
  {
    "start": 109.987,
    "end": 110.627,
    "text": "How in the world?"
  },
  {
    "start": 111.008,
    "end": 112.349,
    "text": "Oh, my goodness."
  },
  {
    "start": 112.889,
    "end": 114.531,
    "text": "And Brandon Carr was back there."
  },
  {
    "start": 114.551,
    "end": 117.373,
    "text": "I mean, he is insane."
  },
  {
    "start": 117.413,
    "end": 118.654,
    "text": "How do you make that catch?"
