    "text": "by george picketts this is a guy that's known when he was in college at georgia vertical stretch the defense make plays incredible ball skills and he says quiet gain of 36 go pretty good coverage by the rookie corner but just drive starts at the one and looking for a little breathing room and they get that and plenty more derrick henry still going"
