    "text": "Touchdown."
  },
  {
    "start": 239.352,
    "end": 242.254,
    "text": "And someone keep an eye on this guy right here, Trey Smith."
  },
  {
    "start": 243.655,
    "end": 250.418,
    "text": "A tremendous block on the Pro Bowl All-Pro safety, Justin Simmons, that opens up the last bit of pathway."
