    "text": "And watch Drew Breeze somehow flip this ball."
  },
  {
    "start": 268.442,
    "end": 271.583,
    "text": "Pierre Thomas, the question is, how was Pierre Thomas expecting that?"
  },
  {
    "start": 272.783,
    "end": 274.444,
    "text": "For Ronald Jones, that's a great start."
  },
  {
    "start": 275.584,
    "end": 277.305,
    "text": "Brady is taken down."
  },
  {
    "start": 277.625,
