    "text": "Khalil Mack steps up and gets a sack."
  },
  {
    "start": 282.206,
    "end": 288.268,
    "text": "Yeah, against the rookie, Tristan Wirfs, and he's able to work around him and get to Brady."
  },
  {
    "start": 288.288,
    "end": 289.669,
    "text": "He's got him one-on-one."
  },
  {
    "start": 289.689,
    "end": 293.69,
    "text": "I mean, he's had his hands full here to start his career."
