    "end": 346.098,
    "text": "Talk about a tough tackle in the open field."
  },
  {
    "start": 346.118,
    "end": 347.039,
    "text": "Look at that spin move."
  },
  {
    "start": 347.099,
    "end": 348.06,
    "text": "Nick Vigil's right there."
  },
  {
    "start": 348.08,
    "end": 352.925,
    "text": "He leads the team in tackles, and he's got no clue as to his leg against the speed of Michael Vick."
  },
  {
    "start": 352.985,
    "end": 354.726,
    "text": "He's replaced by Rasmussen."
  },
  {
    "start": 355.407,
    "end": 360.552,
    "text": "Vick running was tripped up, and he is down at the 46-yard line."
  },
  {
    "start": 360.752,
    "end": 362.814,
    "text": "You don't tackle Mike Vick."
  },
  {
    "start": 363.074,
    "end": 363.795,
    "text": "It's a mistake."
  },
  {
    "start": 365.483,
    "end": 366.424,
    "text": "23-yard line."
  },
  {
    "start": 366.484,
    "end": 367.504,
    "text": "Thickpen goes to work."
  },
  {
    "start": 367.604,
    "end": 368.925,
    "text": "A quick hitter to Charles."
  },
  {
    "start": 369.845,
    "end": 372.406,
    "text": "And Jamal Charles breaks into the clear at the 50."
  },
  {
    "start": 372.687,
    "end": 373.687,
    "text": "He has the speed."
  },
  {
    "start": 373.747,
    "end": 374.567,
    "text": "Can they catch him?"
  },
  {
    "start": 374.587,
    "end": 375.188,
    "text": "25-20."
  },
  {
    "start": 375.208,
    "end": 376.068,
    "text": "15 dead."
  },
  {
    "start": 376.408,
    "end": 381.431,
    "text": "Oh, he's tripped up at the 2-yard line by Jeremiah Bell."
